OVERVIEW
Conveying the exclusivity of the Bulgari brand with customized experiences and luxurious
spa suites. The Bulgari Spa at Bulgari Resort Bali provides the ultimate offering in
terms of treatments, products and services. The Bulgari Spa is the embodiment of
a holistic healing center, bringing together the therapeutic traditions of Indonesian
massage and contemporary spa practices.
An antique ‘Joglo’ house, transported piece by piece from central Java, creates a
unique reception area.
The cliff-top spa at Bulgari Resort Bali offers the ultimate spa experience and
breathtaking views overlooking the Indian Ocean. Traditional Balinese culture and
the elegance of Italian contemporary style are reflected in the exquisite design.
A complete retreat from the rest of the world, The Bulgari Spa extends an enticing
invitation to the guests to enter a world of peace and harmony to experience
a range of result-driven, yet authentic treatments inspired by regional health and
well-being rituals.
BULGARI SIGNATURE RITUALS
The nurturing experience at The Bulgari Spa are inspired by the ancient wellness
traditions of the world. Tension and stress melt away as the mind and spirit find
peace with restorative treatments in one of the luxurious spa suites.
BULGARI ROYAL LULUR FOR TWO 180 Minutes
Treatment created for royalty, this exotic spice and yogurt exfoliation and body polishing
process has been faithfully practiced in the palaces of Central Java since the 17th century.
There, the pursuit of beauty has long been a sacred daily ritual, with the Javanese lulur an
integral step, leaving skin soft, supple and glowing.
An exotic combination of indulgent therapies for couples seeking a complete retreat,
this regal experience for two takes place in the Royal Spa Pavilion. Commence with a
welcoming foot ritual, followed by a skin-exfoliating lulur scrub of rice powder and spices.
A full-body wrap with an algae mask refines the skin. Meanwhile, a cleansing facial takes
place and feet and limbs benefit from an intensive reflex zone massage. The subsequent
facial with Biologique Recherche products balances the skin. Step into the plunge pool
to refresh, then bliss resumes with a perfectly synchronized signature four hands body
massage with rich exotic oils and herbs to complete this decadent, stress relieving and
calming experience.
ROMANTIC HARMONY FOR TWO 180 Minutes
Designed for two, this journey is a perfect way to enjoy a spa experience in
the privacy of the spa suite. Embark on this pampering journey for two, starting
with a foot cleansing ritual. Then, a gentle exfoliating scrub made from coconut
and vanilla prepares the skin to fully absorb the nourishing ingredients, continue
the experience by indulging in the Jacuzzi and essential oil massage. The use
of customized massage oil blends helps to restore and retain moisture in the
deeper levels of the skin, eases muscular tension and invites a sense of bliss. The
subsequent facial with Biologique Recherche products balances the skin.
STRESS RECOVERY 120 Minutes
A refreshing treatment that helps eliminate toxins, smoothen and firm the skin,
providing physical and mental relaxation.
Inducing a state of relaxation, a foot ritual marks the beginning of this thoroughly
de-stressing treatment. Coconut vanilla scrub helps exfoliate and soften tired
skin, followed by massage with fragrant aromatherapy oils to release tension
from tired muscles. The ritual concludes with an express facial to nourish and
hydrate the skin.
BODY THERAPIES
A full body lavish and indulgent pampering with carefully developed body therapies.
Relax, re-energize and boost skin with natural vitamins and minerals, leaving the skin
refreshed and full of life.
BALINESE LULUR 60 Minutes
An Indonesian ritual, traditionally performed on brides before a wedding. Begin the
treatment with foot ritual followed by lulur (body exfoliation) using ground rice, sandalwood
and fragrant spices, before yoghurt mixture body wrap. The ritual concludes with body
lotion applied to sooth and nurture the skin.
BALINESE BOREH 60 Minutes
A healing recipe of indigenous herbs is used as a body exfoliant to warm the body, open
clogged pores and improve circulation. A relaxing head massage is performed while the
spices warm and detoxify the skin. This traditional treatment is commonly used in the
region as a cure for stress-induced headaches, muscular stiffness and even rheumatism.
AFTER SUN SOOTHER 60 Minutes
The After Sun Soother brings instant relief and moisturized dry, sensitive, sunburn or
flaky skin, leaving it calm, hydrated and soft. A coconut scrub is used to gently cleanse
the skin and followed by application of a replenishing body mask comprising nourishing
aloe vera gel. A soothing treat for skin after prolonged exposure to sun.
ANTI-CELLULITE BODY TREATMENT 75 Minutes
A high performance treatment designed to eradicate visible sign of cellulite using a
body wrap that infuses oxygen into skin cells, stimulating release and elimination of
stored fat. Corrective fluids are then applied to specific cellulite-prone areas to refine
and re-sculpt. This treatment concludes with a sculpting massage using deep and effective
movements created to dislodge cellulite while helping to restore toned skin.
MASSAGE THERAPIES
The Bulgari Spa experienced spa therapists combine ancient healing wisdom from
around the world with modern therapies to provide a range of massage techniques
that restore inner calm and rejuvenate the body.
HEALING STONES 120 Minutes
A holistic experience combining the benefits of coconut vanilla scrub and warm
volcanic stones with therapeutic oils to deliver ultimate relaxation for tight and tired
muscles. Heated massage stones enhance the effectiveness of massages stroke to
stimulate blood flow and induce a profound muscular relaxation.
BALINESE FOUR HANDS MASSAGE 120 Minutes
The perfect treatment for those who find it hard to unwind and relax during massage.
Start with a welcome foot ritual followed by a skin-exfoliating lulur scrub and body
massage. A pair of therapists commence the synchronized four hands massage,
tension releasing massage – applying advanced massage combinations of stretching
and rolling movements with long, deep strokes. A mix of hot stones, warm oils and a
therapeutic head massage ensures individual emerges completely relaxed.
HERBAL REVIVAL 120 Minutes
The experience starts with ginger cinnamon scrub followed by a body massage. A healing
massage treatment utilizing warm poultices made of local herbs to calm the nerves and
rebalance energy levels to positively promote circulation and good health. It aims to soothe
muscle tension and stiffness on targeted areas. Heat and herbs are absorbed by the body to
help reduce aches and pains, increase lymphatic drainage and tone the skin.
THAI MASSAGE 90 Minutes
An ancient technique to restore health and vitality with combination of deep pressure point
massage and stretching relieving tension, improving flexibility and blood circulation. Loose
garments are provided and no oil is used during this massage.
TRADITIONAL MASSAGE 90 Minutes
A freestyle Balinese massage technique soothes away tension with choices of massage oil
blend, combined with a suitable pressure to introduce body and mind on a journey of
ultimate relaxation and harmony.
RELAXING BODY MASSAGE 90 Minutes
A deeply soothing and relaxing experience, this treatment utilizes the potent properties
of essential oils applied with long, slow and gentle strokes to the body and scalp. Body and
mind brought back into equilibrium once tensions are released.
RELAXING FOOT MASSAGE 60 Minutes
Revive weary feet and experience deep relaxation and revitalization in this pampering
treatment. Taking inspiration from the Oriental art of reflexology, this delightful foot and
lower leg massage stimulates circulatory and lymphatic systems to leave hard working feet
walking on air. A perfect pampering for tired feet.
FACIAL TREATMENTS
BIOLOGIQUE RECHERCHE
The Biologique Recherche Methodology is based on nearly forty years of experience using
innovative products and meticulous protocols. The products are formulated with high
concentrations of active ingredients derived from natural or biotechnological compounds
and are fragrance-free. Skin care is provided following a personal dermo-cosmetic diagnosis
using a Skin Instant© analysis for each individual.
BRIGHTENING & BALANCING 90 Minutes
A treatment for diminishing fine lines and wrinkles. It tones and refines the skin on
the face, neck and chest. A regenerating and revitalizing treatment for the epidermis,
it restores the natural balance, leaving the skin smooth and glowing. This treatment
helps to re-plump, making the skin supple and healthy.
ANTI AGEING 90 Minutes
An exfoliating and lifting treatment combined with shaping techniques designed
for mature skin. A treatment to prevent and reduce the appearance of dark spots.
It strengthens, firms and hydrates dry damaged skin.
AFTER SUN 60 Minutes
A treatment to stabilize particularly sensitive and fragile skin. It has a soothing effect
on the skin on the face, neck and chest, giving it an extra glow.
PURIFYING FOR MEN 60 Minutes
A treatment that regulates sebaceous secretions and detoxifies oil and acne-prone
skin. It tightens the skin’s pores, leaving the face, neck and chest purified.
HAIR SALON & NAILS CARE
TRADITIONAL HAIR CREAM BATH 60 Minutes
A traditional and therapeutic treatment to stimulate circulation, nourish the scalp
and strengthen the hair.
HAIR SHAMPOO 60 Minutes
MANICURE 60 Minutes
The ultimate treatment for hands, this manicure features scrub and relaxing massage
that will leave hands softer, brighter and younger looking, in addition to nail shaping,
buffing and cuticle nail treatment.
PEDICURE 75 Minutes
Feet are treated to a thorough cleansing and buffing. Starting with an invigorating
foot scrub, lower legs and feet will benefit from an intense exfoliation and soothing
massage, whether for removing a callus, cracked skin or just pure relaxation. A treatment
for the feet’s well-being.
HOW TO SPA
Opening Hours
9 A.M. - 9 P.M.
ARRIVAL TIME
Guests are encouraged to arrive at least 40 minutes prior to the appointment in order to
enjoy the exclusive spa facilities. As a courtesy to the next guest, any late arrival will result
in the reduction of the treatment time. For the guests’ convenience, a robe, towels and
slippers will be provided.
SCHEDULING AN APPOINTMENT
To schedule an appointment for the perfect treatment, please contact spa reservations
team who will be able to recommend right treatment choice. To ensure preferred time
and service is available, advance booking is recommended. Non-residents are welcome to
reserve spa appointments at minimum 2 hours prior to treatment. A credit card will be
required to secure all bookings.
SPA ETIQUETTE
The spa environment is one of relaxation and tranquility. Please respect other guests’
privacy by maintaining a low tone of voice and avoiding to use mobile phones or cameras
within the spa. Smoking is prohibited.
GIFT CERTIFICATES
Gift certificates are available for any treatment or product purchase, non-refundable and
must be presented at the time of the treatment or purchase.
HEALTH CONDITIONS
Kindly advise The Bulgari Spa team of any health conditions, allergies or injuries that could
affect the treatments or use of the facilities when making the spa reservation.
CANCELLATION POLICY
The Bulgari Spa recommends that all modification or cancellation requests done 24
hours prior to the booking in order to avoid a 100% penalty charge. For cancellations
less than 24 hours before the treatment, full payment will be processed. A credit card will
be required to secure all bookings.
MINIMUM AGE
An adult must accompany children under age of 18 during the spa treatment.
PRICES & TAXES
All prices are subject to prevailing tax and service charge. Prices are subject to change
at management’s discretion.
